a. Participation in a multidisciplinary QI committee;
b. Collection, trending analysis, and evaluation of data, along with planning, interventions, and
reassessments;
c. Analysis of the need for ongoing education and training;
d. On-site monitoring of health service outcomes on a regular basis through:
